This repository contains original source code only. It does not include,
redistribute or relicense any third-party binary, sound, image or SDK. The
software interoperates with separately installed products that remain subject
to their own licenses and terms:

- Microsoft Windows 11, the Xbox full screen experience API
  (GamingExperience), WinRT and the .NET Framework. Called through public,
  documented APIs only; no Microsoft binary is modified or injected.
- Steam and Steam Big Picture, Valve Corporation. Driven through steam://
  protocol links and read-only reads of Steam's own local files, which are not a
  stable public contract.
- DSX (DualSenseX), Paliverse. Restored through the normal window APIs; its
  configuration and profiles are never written.
- HidHide, Nefarius Software Solutions. Configured by the user, never by this
  software.
- AMD Software: Adrenalin Edition and the AMD Device Library eXtra (ADLX).
  ADLX is called from C# through the interface layout published in AMD's ADLX
  SDK headers (MIT License, https://github.com/GPUOpen-LibrariesAndSDKs/ADLX).
  No SDK file is included.
- HWiNFO (REALiX) shared memory and RivaTuner Statistics Server (Guru3D)
  shared memory, read according to their public documentation.

The DualSense HID report layout was checked against the SDL project's HIDAPI
driver (zlib License, https://github.com/libsdl-org/SDL). No SDL code is
included.

